Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 01:58:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Style the first letter of a block with ::first-letter

Port of https://github.com/DioxusLabs/blitz/pull/1740.

Adapted to this version's node storage: the first-letter node id lives in ElementRare (first_letter()/set_first_letter()) next to before/after, and the inline builder changes go to build_inline_layout_into in layout/construct.rs (split_first_letter and its test too). Unlike upstream, dropping an element also drops its first-letter node (drop_node_ignoring_parent_with), so the slot does not leak.

Left out, outside the crate: Cargo.lock, tests/blitz-tests/Cargo.toml, tests/blitz-tests/tests/all.rs, tests/blitz-tests/tests/first_letter.rs.
